src/security_auditor/vendor/mantis_llm_gateway.py is copied unchanged from
reference/core/llm_gateway.py. It supplies SecretScrubber and untrusted-content
wrapping. The original file and license are retained.

src/security_auditor/vendor/mantis contains the pinned reference core, tools,
main campaign driver, workflow and all top-level skills with their references.
SOURCE.json records every file's upstream path, hash and modification status.
The environment registry and sandbox factory are restricted to static-only;
the remaining upstream source is retained unchanged. The application adapters
are mantis_engine.py and mantis_worker.py, including offline grammar loading,
literal full-skill binding, persistent budget accounting and output mapping.
The native campaign driver, graph compiler, review branches, deduplication,
structural index and risk calibration run directly from this source.

The versioned skills adapt Mantis architecture, planning, research, independent
review, critic and calibration methods for document requirements and static
analysis. Each skill manifest records its upstream source and modifications
are described in docs/mantis-skills-review.md. The new domain schemas, storage,
task scheduler, API and frontend are independent implementations.

Google ADK, LiteLLM, FastAPI, React, Ant Design and Docling are dependencies;
their licenses and notices remain distributed by their original packages.
